#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:118
msgid ""
"By default the gateway waits for the context (prefill) response before "
"forwarding the generation (decode) request. To run both legs "
"concurrently, set ``AIBRIX_TRT_SCHEDULE_STYLE=generation_first`` on the "
"**gateway plugin** Deployment and restart its pods:"
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，网关会等待 context（prefill）响应后再转发 generation（decode）请求。要让两段并发执行，请在**网关插件** "
"Deployment 上设置 ``AIBRIX_TRT_SCHEDULE_STYLE=generation_first`` 并重启其 Pod："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:129
msgid "Prerequisites:"
msgstr "Prerequisites:"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:131
msgid ""
"Workers implementing the TRT-LLM ``1.3.0rc8`` OpenAI disaggregation "
"protocol (the version in the TensorRT quickstart). P/D must use matching "
"model, tokenizer and chat template, because this mode cannot wait for "
"CTX's returned ``prompt_token_ids``."
msgstr ""
"Worker 需实现 TRT-LLM ``1.3.0rc8`` OpenAI 分离协议（TensorRT 快速入门中的版本）。P/D "
"必须使用匹配的模型、tokenizer 和 chat template，因为该模式无法等待 CTX 返回的 ``prompt_token_ids``。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:135
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Both roles must run TRT-LLM's **Python** KV-cache transceiver "
"(``cache_transceiver_config: {backend: DEFAULT|NIXL, transceiver_runtime:"
" PYTHON}``). Only it reports the generation-first metadata; a worker with"
" the default C++ transceiver answers ``/server_info`` with an empty "
"``disaggregated_params``. The quickstart's ``tensor-rt-pd.yaml`` ships "
"with this line commented out for context-first, so uncomment it on both "
"roles before enabling the mode."
msgstr ""
"两个角色都必须运行 TRT-LLM 的 **Python** KV-cache "
"transceiver（``cache_transceiver_config: {backend: DEFAULT|NIXL, "
"transceiver_runtime: PYTHON}``）。只有它会报告 generation-first 元数据；使用默认 C++ "
"transceiver 的 worker 在 ``/server_info`` 中返回空的 "
"``disaggregated_params``。快速入门的 ``tensor-rt-pd.yaml`` 为 context-first "
"注释了该行，启用该模式前请在两个角色上都取消注释。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:141
msgid ""
"Keep Envoy ``failure_mode_allow=false`` so context failures reset the "
"upstream stream and the engine cancels the generation leg."
msgstr ""
"保持 Envoy ``failure_mode_allow=false``，以便 context 失败时重置上游流，引擎取消 generation "
"阶段。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:143
msgid ""
"Assign different ``AIBRIX_TRT_MACHINE_ID`` values to gateway processes "
"sharing TRT workers, as with context-first routing."
msgstr ""
"与 context-first 路由一样，共享 TRT worker 的网关进程必须设置不同的 ``AIBRIX_TRT_MACHINE_ID``。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:146
msgid ""
"The gateway loads the selected CTX worker's ``/server_info`` lazily "
"(3-second lookup timeout, 1-minute TTL), prepares a shared "
"``disagg_request_id`` and ``schedule_style=1`` on both legs, sends CTX in"
" a goroutine, and immediately lets Envoy forward GEN. The KV transfer "
"stays between the engines; the gateway neither transfers KV nor sends a "
"duplicate GEN HTTP request. Missing or invalid metadata fails routing "
"before either inference request is sent. See "
"``pkg/plugins/gateway/algorithms/pd_readme.md`` for the request sequence "
"and failure handling."
msgstr ""
"网关惰性加载所选 CTX worker 的 ``/server_info``（查找超时 3 秒，TTL 1 分钟），在两段上准备共享的 "
"``disagg_request_id`` 和 ``schedule_style=1``，在 goroutine 中发送 CTX，并立即让 Envoy "
"转发 GEN。KV 传输仍在引擎之间完成；网关既不传输 KV，也不发送重复的 GEN HTTP "
"请求。元数据缺失或无效会在发送任何推理请求之前使路由失败。请求序列和失败处理见 "
"``pkg/plugins/gateway/algorithms/pd_readme.md``。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:155
msgid ""
"Begin with text-only 1P1D; ``samples/quickstart/tensorrt/README.md`` "
"carries the smoke test. Set ``AIBRIX_TRT_SCHEDULE_STYLE=context_first`` "
"and restart the gateway to roll back. Other engines and combined-pod "
"routing are unaffected, and an unrecognized value is logged and leaves "
"the router on ``context_first``."
msgstr ""
"先从纯文本 1P1D 开始；冒烟测试见 ``samples/quickstart/tensorrt/README.md``。回滚时设置 "
"``AIBRIX_TRT_SCHEDULE_STYLE=context_first`` 并重启网关。其他引擎和 combined Pod "
"路由不受影响；无法识别的值会记入日志，路由器保持 ``context_first``。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:162
msgid "SGLang Decode Watchdog"
msgstr "SGLang Decode 看门狗"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:164
msgid ""
"With SGLang, the prefill request only returns once the decode pod has "
"taken the KV transfer, so from then on the decode pod owes the client a "
"response. If the decode pod stops answering (for example its scheduler "
"crashed or hung), the gateway fails the request instead of leaving the "
"client waiting for Envoy's route timeout, and asks the decode pod to drop"
" the request through ``/abort_request``. If no response headers have "
"reached the client yet, it answers ``504`` with the ``x-error-pd-decode: "
"true`` header. Otherwise it cuts the stream short: the client sees a "
"``200`` with a truncated body and a stream error, not an error body. A "
"failed prefill leg similarly answers with ``x-error-pd-prefill: true``, "
"so a 5xx from the decode pod itself is distinguishable from a gateway-"
"generated PD failure."
msgstr ""
"在 SGLang 中，prefill 请求只有在 decode Pod 接收 KV 传输之后才返回，此后 decode Pod 就欠客户端一个响应。若 "
"decode Pod 停止应答（例如调度器崩溃或挂起），网关会失败该请求，而不是让客户端一直等到 Envoy 的路由超时，并通过 "
"``/abort_request`` 让 decode Pod 丢弃请求。若响应头尚未到达客户端，网关返回 ``504`` 并带 "
"``x-error-pd-decode: true``。否则截断流：客户端看到的是带截断正文和流错误的 ``200``，而不是错误体。prefill "
"阶段失败同样会返回 ``x-error-pd-prefill: true``，从而把 decode Pod 自身的 5xx 与网关生成的 PD "
"失败区分开。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:176
msgid ""
"``AIBRIX_DECODE_FIRST_RESPONSE_TIMEOUT`` (default ``60``): seconds a "
"streaming request waits for the decode pod's first token (its first "
"response body chunk) after the prefill succeeded. SGLang sends the "
"response headers of a stream before the first token, so the headers alone"
" do not stop this timer."
msgstr ""
"``AIBRIX_DECODE_FIRST_RESPONSE_TIMEOUT``（默认 ``60``）：流式请求在 prefill 成功后，等待 "
"decode Pod 首个 token（第一个响应体分片）的秒数。SGLang 会在首 token 之前发送流的响应头，因此仅有响应头不会停止该计时器。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:180
msgid ""
"``AIBRIX_DECODE_RESPONSE_TIMEOUT`` (default ``0``, disabled): the same "
"bound for a non-streaming request. The decode pod only answers such a "
"request when the whole generation is done, so a safe value depends on "
"``max_tokens`` and decode throughput."
msgstr ""
"``AIBRIX_DECODE_RESPONSE_TIMEOUT``（默认 ``0``，关闭）：非流式请求的同样上限。decode Pod "
"只在整段生成完成后才应答此类请求，因此安全取值取决于 ``max_tokens`` 和 decode 吞吐。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:183
msgid ""
"``AIBRIX_DECODE_STREAM_IDLE_TIMEOUT`` (default ``120``): streaming "
"requests only. Once the first token arrived, the longest gap allowed "
"between two chunks before the gateway cuts the stream short and aborts "
"the decode request."
msgstr ""
"``AIBRIX_DECODE_STREAM_IDLE_TIMEOUT``（默认 ``120``）：仅用于流式请求。首 token "
"到达后，两个分片之间允许的最长间隔；超时则网关截断流并中止 decode 请求。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:187
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``gateway_request_model_fail_total{status=\"pd_decode_watchdog\"}`` "
"counts every request the watchdog failed, with ``status_code=\"504\"`` "
"even when the client saw a cut ``200`` stream."
msgstr ""
"``gateway_request_model_fail_total{status=\"pd_decode_watchdog\"}`` "
"统计看门狗失败的每个请求；即使客户端看到的是被截断的 ``200`` 流，``status_code`` 仍为 ``\"504\"``。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:191
msgid ""
"``0`` disables any of them. All three can also be set per config profile "
"(see below)."
msgstr "设为 ``0`` 可关闭其中任意一项。这三项也可以按配置档案单独设置（见下文）。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:195
