#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:283
msgid "Step 3 — Add Standard Inference Pods (Optional)"
msgstr "步骤 3 — 添加标准推理 Pod（可选）"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:286
msgid ""
"Standard inference pods are entirely optional. A pure prefill/decode "
"deployment works without them. Think of them as a power-up: they unlock a"
" second execution path that the gateway can exploit to absorb overflow, "
"handle workloads outside your configured prompt-length buckets, and "
"smooth out traffic spikes — all without spinning up a separate deployment"
" or changing a single line of client code."
msgstr ""
"标准推理 Pod 完全可选。纯 Prefill/Decode "
"部署没有它们也能工作。可以把它们看作增强：它们解锁第二条执行路径，网关可用它吸收溢出、处理超出已配置 prompt "
"长度分桶的负载，并平滑流量尖峰——无需另起一套部署，也不必改一行客户端代码。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:288
msgid ""
"Adding standard inference pods turns a rigid two-tier pipeline into a "
"self-healing, adaptive system. When PD capacity is saturated or a request"
" falls outside the bucket ranges you've configured, the gateway "
"automatically falls back to a standard inference pod and keeps the "
"request moving rather than rejecting it or queueing indefinitely. The "
"result is higher effective throughput, more consistent tail latency, and "
"a gentler on-ramp for teams migrating incrementally from a standard "
"deployment to full PD disaggregation."
msgstr ""
"加入标准推理 Pod 后，刚性的两层流水线会变成可自愈、自适应的系统。当 PD 容量饱和，或请求落在已配置分桶范围之外时，网关会自动回退到标准推理"
" Pod，让请求继续前进，而不是拒绝或无限排队。结果是更高的有效吞吐、更稳定的尾延迟，以及从标准部署逐步迁移到完整 Prefill/Decode "
"分离时更平缓的过渡。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:290
msgid ""
"Standard inference pods run both prefill and decode on a single GPU. They"
" serve as overflow capacity when:"
msgstr "标准推理 Pod 在单块 GPU 上同时运行 prefill 和 decode。在以下情况作为溢出容量："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:292
msgid "The request's prompt length falls outside all configured PD buckets."
msgstr "请求的 prompt 长度超出所有已配置的 PD 分桶。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:293
msgid ""
"The matching PD roleset is incomplete (for example, a decode pod is "
"unavailable)."
msgstr "匹配的 PD roleset 不完整（例如 decode Pod 不可用）。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:294
msgid ""
"All prefill/decode pairs are at capacity (load-imbalance routing may "
"select a combined pod)."
msgstr "所有 prefill/decode 配对都已满载（负载不均衡路由可能选择 combined Pod）。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:295
msgid ""
"You want a gradual migration path (run standard inference pods alongside "
"disaggregated pairs)."
msgstr "需要渐进迁移路径（标准推理 Pod 与分离配对并行运行）。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:297
msgid ""
"**To configure a standard inference pod**, set ``combined: true`` in the "
"pod's ``routingConfig`` annotation and enable prompt-length bucketing on "
"the gateway:"
msgstr ""
"**要配置标准推理 Pod** ，请在该 Pod 的 ``routingConfig`` 注解中设置 ``combined: true`` "
"，并在网关上启用 prompt 长度分桶："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:318
msgid ""
"Enable prompt-length bucketing on the gateway plugin (add to its "
"Deployment environment, or set "
"``gatewayPlugin.container.envs.AIBRIX_PROMPT_LENGTH_BUCKETING`` in Helm "
"values):"
msgstr ""
"在网关插件上启用 prompt 长度分桶（加入 Deployment 环境变量，或在 Helm values 中设置 "
"``gatewayPlugin.container.envs.AIBRIX_PROMPT_LENGTH_BUCKETING``）："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:326
msgid ""
"With bucketing enabled, the gateway considers a standard inference pod as"
" a candidate only when the request's prompt length falls within the pod's"
" configured range (see below). Without a range configured, a standard "
"inference pod accepts any prompt length."
msgstr ""
"启用分桶后，仅当请求的 prompt 长度落在该 Pod 配置范围内时，网关才会把标准推理 Pod 视为候选（见下文）。未配置范围时，标准推理 "
"Pod 接受任意 prompt 长度。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:330
msgid "Encode Pods for Multimodal Requests (EPD)"
msgstr "多模态请求的 Encode Pod（EPD）"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:332
msgid ""
"With vLLM, a roleset can also run the vision or audio encoder on its own "
"pods, labeled ``role-name: encode`` with the same ``roleset-name`` as the"
" prefill and decode pods. For a ``/v1/chat/completions`` request that "
"carries ``image_url``, ``audio_url``, ``input_audio`` or ``video_url`` "
"items, the gateway first sends each item to one of the selected roleset's"
" encode pods, in parallel, and waits for them before the prefill request."
" Text-only requests, other endpoints and rolesets without encode pods "
"route exactly as before. Encode pods are never picked as prefill, decode "
"or standard inference pods."
msgstr ""
"使用 vLLM 时，roleset 还可以在独立的 Pod 上运行视觉或音频编码器：这些 Pod 标记为 ``role-name: encode`` ，"
"并与 prefill、decode Pod 使用相同的 ``roleset-name`` 。对于携带 ``image_url`` 、``audio_url`` "
"、``input_audio`` 或 ``video_url`` 项的 ``/v1/chat/completions`` 请求，网关会先将每一项并行发送到所选 "
"roleset 中的某个 encode Pod，等它们完成后再发出 prefill 请求。纯文本请求、其他端点以及没有 encode Pod 的 "
"roleset 的路由方式保持不变。Encode Pod 永远不会被选为 prefill、decode 或标准推理 Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:334
msgid ""
"The media items stay on the request. The encode pods store their output "
"through vLLM's EC connector, keyed by the hash of each media item, and "
"the prefill pod finds it under the same hash. The gateway drops any "
"``ec_transfer_params`` the client sent and sets the ones the encode "
"responses carry, if any, on the prefill request. If an item's output is not "
"there, for example because its encode request failed, the prefill pod "
"encodes the item itself, so a failed encode costs latency but not the "
"request. Each encode request uses the prefill request timeout, and "
"``gateway_pd_encode_request_total`` counts them by ``status``."
msgstr ""
"媒体项保留在请求中。Encode Pod 通过 vLLM 的 EC connector 保存输出，以每个媒体项的哈希为键，prefill Pod "
"用同一哈希找到它。网关会丢弃客户端发送的 ``ec_transfer_params`` ，如果 encode 响应带有 ``ec_transfer_params`` ，"
"则将其设置到 prefill 请求上。如果某一项的输出不存在（例如其 encode 请求失败），prefill Pod 会自行编码该项，因此 encode "
"失败只会增加延迟，不会导致请求失败。每个 encode 请求使用 prefill 请求超时， ``gateway_pd_encode_request_total`` "
"按 ``status`` 统计这些请求。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:336
msgid ""
"Start the encode pods as encoder-only producers and the prefill pods as "
"consumers of the same EC connector. With ``ECExampleConnector``, the "
"encode and prefill pods must mount the same volume, such as a "
"``ReadWriteMany`` PVC or a ``hostPath`` on one node. Otherwise the "
"prefill pod never finds the encoder output and encodes every item itself."
" ``samples/disaggregation/vllm/1e1p1d.yaml`` is a complete example:"
msgstr ""
"将 encode Pod 启动为仅运行编码器的生产者，将 prefill Pod 启动为同一 EC connector 的消费者。使用 "
"``ECExampleConnector`` 时，encode Pod 和 prefill Pod 必须挂载同一个卷，例如 ``ReadWriteMany`` "
"PVC 或同一节点上的 ``hostPath`` 。否则 prefill Pod 永远找不到编码器输出，会自行编码每一项。完整示例见 "
"``samples/disaggregation/vllm/1e1p1d.yaml`` ："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:349
msgid ""
"With ``ECCPUConnector`` and ``\"ec_enable_nixl\": true``, the prefill pod "
"pulls each output from the encode pod over NIXL instead, so no shared "
"volume is needed. Set ``VLLM_EC_SIDE_CHANNEL_HOST`` on the encode pods to"
" the pod IP, since that is the address they hand out in "
"``ec_transfer_params``. ``ECCPUConnector`` needs vLLM 0.32.0 or later and"
" ``VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1`` on both sides. "
"``samples/disaggregation/vllm/1e1p1d-ec-nixl.yaml`` is an example."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``ECCPUConnector`` 并设置 ``\"ec_enable_nixl\": true`` 时，prefill Pod 会通过 NIXL "
"直接从 encode Pod 拉取每个输出，因此不需要共享卷。请将 encode Pod 的 ``VLLM_EC_SIDE_CHANNEL_HOST`` "
"设置为 Pod IP，因为 encode Pod 会在 ``ec_transfer_params`` 中提供这个地址。 ``ECCPUConnector`` 需要 "
"vLLM 0.32.0 或更高版本，并且两端都要设置 ``VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1`` 。示例见 "
"``samples/disaggregation/vllm/1e1p1d-ec-nixl.yaml`` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:351
msgid ""
"Encode pods can also sit in front of pods that serve the whole request, "
"with no prefill/decode split (E+PD). With any routing strategy other than"
" ``pd``, the gateway never routes a request to an encode pod, and when "
"the pod it picks has encode pods in its roleset, it runs the same encode "
"stage before forwarding the request. With ``pd`` routing, the same "
"happens when the router picks a standard inference pod instead of a "
"prefill/decode pair. That pod is then the EC consumer. The encode stage "
"runs before the request is forwarded, so an encode pod that stops "
"responding delays each multimodal request by up to the prefill request "
"timeout (``AIBRIX_PREFILL_REQUEST_TIMEOUT``, 30 seconds by default). "
"``samples/disaggregation/vllm/1e1pd.yaml`` is an example."
msgstr ""
"Encode Pod 也可以放在处理完整请求、不做 prefill/decode 拆分的 Pod 之前（E+PD）。使用 ``pd`` "
"以外的任何路由策略时，网关永远不会把请求路由到 encode Pod；如果所选 Pod 的 roleset 中有 encode Pod，网关会在转发请求前执行同样的 "
"encode 阶段。使用 ``pd`` 路由时，如果路由器选择的是标准推理 Pod 而不是 prefill/decode 组合，也会执行同样的流程。此时该 Pod "
"就是 EC 消费者。encode 阶段在转发请求之前执行，因此如果 encode Pod 停止响应，每个多模态请求最多会被延迟 prefill "
"请求超时时间（ ``AIBRIX_PREFILL_REQUEST_TIMEOUT`` ，默认 30 秒）。示例见 ``samples/disaggregation/vllm/1e1pd.yaml`` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:353
msgid ""
"See vLLM's `disaggregated encoder "
"<https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/features/disagg_encoder/>`_ documentation"
" for the encoder flags. Connectors that need the gateway to pick the "
"consumer before encoding, such as ``ECMooncakeConnector``, are not "
"supported yet."
msgstr ""
"编码器相关参数请参阅 vLLM 的 `disaggregated encoder "
"<https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/features/disagg_encoder/>`_ 文档。需要网关在编码前选定消费者的 "
"connector（例如 ``ECMooncakeConnector`` ）暂不支持。"

