#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:373
msgid ""
"The same ``routingConfig`` object also carries the prefill/decode routing"
" thresholds of a profile's requests, flat under ``pd``: "
"``prefillRequestTimeout``, the spread thresholds "
"(``prefillLoadImbalanceMinSpread``, ``decodeLoadImbalanceMinSpread``, "
"``decodeThroughputImbalanceMinSpread``, ``decodeScoreRatioThreshold``), "
"the decode load-balance weights (``decodeLBWeightRunning``, "
"``decodeLBWeightThroughput``), the token-load charge knobs "
"(``tokenLoadKVWeight``, ``tokenLoadRequestCost``, "
"``tokenLoadTTLSeconds``, ``tokenLoadSessionTTLSeconds``), "
"``hybridCacheLoadFactor``, ``minMatchPct``, the abort timeout and retry "
"delay (``decodeAbortTimeout``, ``decodeAbortRetryDelay``), and the decode"
" watchdog timeouts (``decodeFirstResponseTimeout``, "
"``decodeResponseTimeout``, ``decodeStreamIdleTimeout``). Each one "
"overrides the matching gateway environment variable for that profile "
"only; unset fields keep the environment default. See "
":ref:`per_request_routing_knobs` in :doc:`gateway-plugins` for the full "
"list."
msgstr ""
"同一 ``routingConfig`` 对象还承载该档案请求的 prefill/decode 路由阈值，平铺在 ``pd`` "
"下：``prefillRequestTimeout``、spread "
"阈值（``prefillLoadImbalanceMinSpread``、``decodeLoadImbalanceMinSpread``、``deco"
"deThroughputImbalanceMinSpread``、``decodeScoreRatioThreshold``）、decode "
"负载均衡权重（``decodeLBWeightRunning``、``decodeLBWeightThroughput``）、token-load "
"计费旋钮（``tokenLoadKVWeight``、``tokenLoadRequestCost``、``tokenLoadTTLSeconds``、"
"``tokenLoadSessionTTLSeconds``）、``hybridCacheLoadFactor``、``minMatchPct``、中止"
"超时和重试延迟（``decodeAbortTimeout``、``decodeAbortRetryDelay``），以及 decode "
"看门狗超时（``decodeFirstResponseTimeout``、``decodeResponseTimeout``、``decodeStrea"
"mIdleTimeout``）。每一项只覆盖该档案对应的网关环境变量；未设置的字段保持环境默认值。完整列表见 "
":doc:`gateway-plugins` 中的 :ref:`per_request_routing_knobs`。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:388
msgid ""
"Bucketing only takes effect when ``AIBRIX_PROMPT_LENGTH_BUCKETING=true`` "
"is set on the gateway plugin."
msgstr "仅当网关插件设置 ``AIBRIX_PROMPT_LENGTH_BUCKETING=true`` 时，分桶才会生效。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:392
msgid "Adaptive Bucket Serving"
msgstr "自适应分桶服务"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:394
msgid ""
"``AIBRIX_BUCKET_SERVE=true`` adds an adaptive plan on top of bucketing, "
"which must also be on. Plain bucketing keeps every roleset whose declared"
" range covers the request as a candidate and lets the scoring decide "
"among them. With adaptive bucket serving, the gateway keeps a per-model "
"picture of the prompt lengths it routes, charges every roleset the "
"traffic only it can serve, and splits a range that several rolesets still"
" need into one band per roleset. Each band is debited against one "
"replica-proportional share, so a roleset carrying several overlaps draws "
"against a single share instead of one per range, and cut points sit at "
"quantiles of the observed traffic instead of at hand-written boundaries."
msgstr ""
"``AIBRIX_BUCKET_SERVE=true`` 在分桶之上增加自适应计划，分桶本身也必须开启。普通分桶会保留声明范围覆盖该请求的每个 "
"roleset 作为候选，再由打分在它们之间选择。启用自适应分桶服务后，网关维护每个模型所路由 prompt 长度的画像，只把某 roleset "
"独有的流量记到它头上，并把多个 roleset 仍需覆盖的区间按 roleset "
"拆成一条条带宽。每条带宽从一份与副本成比例的份额中扣减，因此承担多段重叠的 roleset "
"只消耗一份份额而不是每个区间一份，切分点落在观测流量的分位数上，而不是手写边界。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:403
msgid ""
"``AIBRIX_BUCKET_SERVE_MODE`` picks the unit those cut points are measured"
" in: ``throughput`` (default) balances prompt-token mass, while ``rps`` "
"balances request counts. Within a shared range the bands divide the "
"observed traffic in proportion to the replica share each roleset still "
"needs, counted in that unit."
msgstr ""
"``AIBRIX_BUCKET_SERVE_MODE`` 选择切分点使用的单位：``throughput`` （默认）平衡 prompt token "
"质量，``rps`` 平衡请求数。在共享区间内，各带宽按每个 roleset 仍需要的副本份额（以该单位计）按比例划分观测流量。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:408
msgid ""
"The plan is advisory. It narrows the rolesets a request may reach only "
"when the banded roleset still has both prefill and decode candidates "
"after the load-imbalance fast paths; wherever the plan holds no band, or "
"the banded roleset has no candidate left, the request routes exactly as "
"it would without the plan. With the feature off, the planner records and "
"publishes nothing."
msgstr ""
"该计划是建议性的。只有在负载不均衡快路径之后，被划入带宽的 roleset 仍同时拥有 prefill 和 decode "
"候选时，它才会收窄请求可到达的 roleset；计划没有带宽，或该带宽的 roleset "
"已无候选时，请求的路由与未启用计划时完全相同。功能关闭时，规划器既不记录也不发布任何内容。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:415
