msgstr "Conductor 打分策略"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:417
msgid ""
"The ``conductor`` scoring policy selects pods by estimating latency for "
"both prefill and decode phases, combining real-time metrics with workload"
" characteristics."
msgstr "``conductor`` 打分策略通过估计 prefill 和 decode 两个阶段的延迟来选择 Pod，并把实时指标与负载特征结合起来。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:419
msgid "**Prefill Scoring**"
