#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:421
msgid "Estimates Time To First Token (TTFT) by considering:"
msgstr "通过以下因素估计 Time To First Token（TTFT）："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:423
