#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:432
msgid "**Batch scaling** — TBT increases as batch size grows"
msgstr "**批处理放大** — 批大小增大时 TBT 上升"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:433
msgid "**GPU pressure** — Applies a penalty when cache usage exceeds 90%"
msgstr "**GPU 压力** — cache 使用率超过 90% 时施加惩罚"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:435
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:523
