"This example shows a three-tier setup: prefill + decode pods for short "
"prompts, and standard inference pods for long prompts or overflow."
msgstr "该示例展示三层设置：短 prompt 用 prefill + decode Pod，长 prompt 或溢出用标准推理 Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:642
msgid "**Prefill pod** (short prompts: 0–2048 tokens):"
msgstr "**Prefill Pod** （短 prompt：0–2048 token）："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:667
msgid "**Decode pod** (paired with the prefill pod above):"
msgstr "**Decode Pod** （与上面的 prefill Pod 配对）："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:692
msgid "**Standard inference pod** (long prompts: 2048+ tokens, and overflow):"
msgstr "**标准推理 Pod** （长 prompt：2048+ token，以及溢出）："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:715
msgid "**Gateway plugin** (enable bucketing):"
msgstr "**网关插件** （启用分桶）："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:726
msgid "Pod Selection Algorithm"
msgstr "Pod 选择算法"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:728
msgid ""
"Once pods are partitioned into prefill, decode, and combined slices, the "
"gateway selects the best target through a cascade of checks. Bucketing "
"(when ``AIBRIX_PROMPT_LENGTH_BUCKETING=true``) runs first; load-imbalance"
" and scoring steps run only when a PD pair is still in play."
msgstr ""
"Pod 被划分为 prefill、decode 和 combined 切片后，网关通过级联检查选择最佳目标。分桶（当 "
"``AIBRIX_PROMPT_LENGTH_BUCKETING=true`` ）最先运行；仅当 PD "
"配对仍在候选中时，才运行负载不均衡和打分步骤。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:730
msgid "**Step 0 — Prompt-length bucketing (optional)**"
msgstr "**步骤 0 — Prompt 长度分桶（可选）**"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:732
msgid ""
"When bucketing is enabled, each roleset contributes to the bucket-"
"filtered pool only when **both** its prefill and decode pods declare a "
"range that includes the request's prompt length. Incomplete rolesets "
"(missing decode or prefill) are skipped. If no complete bucket-matched "
"pair exists — including when a decode pod is down in the matching bucket "
"— the gateway routes to a ``combined: true`` pod whose range includes the"
" prompt, or returns an error if none is available. When a bucket match "
"exists but PD pods are heavily loaded while a combined pod is idle, "
"``shouldPickCombined()`` may select the combined pod instead."
msgstr ""
"启用分桶时，仅当 roleset 的 prefill 和 decode Pod **都** 声明了包含该请求 prompt 长度的范围时，该 "
"roleset 才会进入分桶过滤池。不完整的 roleset（缺少 decode 或 "
"prefill）会被跳过。若不存在完整的分桶匹配配对——包括匹配分桶中 decode Pod 宕机——网关会路由到范围包含该 prompt 的 "
"``combined: true`` Pod；若没有可用则返回错误。当分桶匹配存在，但 PD Pod 负载很重而 combined Pod "
"空闲时，``shouldPickCombined()`` 可能改选 combined Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:734
msgid "**Step 1 — Prefill load-imbalance fast path**"
msgstr "**步骤 1 — Prefill 负载不均衡快速路径**"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:736
msgid ""
"If the difference between the maximum and minimum number of outstanding "
"prefill requests across prefill pods exceeds "
"``AIBRIX_PREFILL_LOAD_IMBALANCE_MIN_SPREAD``, the gateway routes the "
"prefill phase to the single least-loaded prefill pod and aligns the "
"decode candidates to the same roleset."
msgstr ""
"若各 prefill Pod 上未完成 prefill 请求数的最大值与最小值之差超过 "
"``AIBRIX_PREFILL_LOAD_IMBALANCE_MIN_SPREAD`` ，网关会把 prefill 阶段路由到负载最低的单个 "
"prefill Pod，并把 decode 候选对齐到同一 roleset。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:738
msgid "**Step 2 — Decode load-imbalance fast path**"
msgstr "**步骤 2 — Decode 负载不均衡快速路径**"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:740
msgid ""
"Three ordered checks run against decode pods. The first that fires "
"selects a single decode pod and aligns the prefill candidates to its "
"roleset. Steps 1 and 2 are independent: both can fire on the same request"
" if both sides are imbalanced."
msgstr ""
"对 decode Pod 按顺序做三次检查。最先触发的一次会选出单个 decode Pod，并把 prefill 候选对齐到其 "
"roleset。步骤 1 和 2 相互独立：若两侧都不均衡，同一请求上两者都可以触发。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:742
msgid ""
"*Request count spread* — If ``max(running + pending) − min`` across "
"metric-bearing pods ≥ ``AIBRIX_DECODE_LOAD_IMBALANCE_MIN_SPREAD``, route "
"to the least-loaded pod. Pods without ``RealtimeNumRequestsRunning`` are "
"excluded from the spread to avoid thundering-herd on freshly restarted "
"pods; their pending-decode count is still tracked for the scoring step."
msgstr ""
"*请求数差* — 若带指标 Pod 上 ``max(running + pending) − min`` ≥ "
"``AIBRIX_DECODE_LOAD_IMBALANCE_MIN_SPREAD`` ，则路由到负载最低的 Pod。没有 "
"``RealtimeNumRequestsRunning`` 的 Pod 不参与该差值计算，以免刚重启的 Pod 被惊群；其 pending-"
"decode 计数仍会在打分步骤中跟踪。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:744
msgid ""
"*Throughput spread* — If ``max(throughput) − min`` across metric-bearing "
"pods > ``AIBRIX_DECODE_THROUGHPUT_IMBALANCE_MIN_SPREAD``, route to the "
"lowest-throughput pod."
msgstr ""
"*吞吐差* — 若带指标 Pod 上 ``max(throughput) − min`` > "
"``AIBRIX_DECODE_THROUGHPUT_IMBALANCE_MIN_SPREAD`` ，则路由到吞吐最低的 Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:746
msgid ""
"*Drain-rate score* — If all pods report a positive ``drain_rate``, score "
"each pod as ``effective_running_reqs / drain_rate``. If ``max_score / "
"min_score`` exceeds ``AIBRIX_DECODE_SCORE_RATIO_THRESHOLD``, route to the"
" pod with the lowest score (fastest estimated queue drain)."
msgstr ""
"*排空速率分数* — 若所有 Pod 都报告正的 ``drain_rate`` ，则每个 Pod 打分为 "
"``effective_running_reqs / drain_rate`` 。若 ``max_score / min_score`` 超过 "
"``AIBRIX_DECODE_SCORE_RATIO_THRESHOLD`` ，则路由到分数最低的 Pod（估计队列排空最快）。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:748
msgid "**Step 2b — Adaptive bucket serving (optional)**"
msgstr "**步骤 2b — 自适应分桶服务（可选）**"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:750
msgid ""
"When ``AIBRIX_BUCKET_SERVE=true`` and bucketing is on, the gateway "
"prefers the roleset a request length is banded to (see `Adaptive Bucket "
"Serving`_). The preference only applies when that roleset still has both "
"prefill and decode candidates after steps 1 and 2; otherwise the fast "
"paths' choice stands."
msgstr ""
"当 ``AIBRIX_BUCKET_SERVE=true`` 且分桶开启时，网关优先选择请求长度被划入的 roleset（见 `Adaptive "
"Bucket Serving`_）。仅当该 roleset 在步骤 1 和 2 之后仍同时拥有 prefill 和 decode "
"候选时才应用该偏好；否则沿用快路径的选择。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:755
msgid "**Step 3 — Prefill scoring**"
msgstr "**步骤 3 — Prefill 打分**"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:757
msgid ""
"Each prefill pod is scored by the selected policy. Pods with a request "
"count more than ``N`` standard deviations above the mean are skipped (``N"
" = AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_STANDARD_DEVIATION_FACTOR``), and so are pods with "
"a request count above ``c × (mean + 1)`` (``c = "
"AIBRIX_PREFILL_LOAD_CAP_FACTOR``). The standard-deviation check cannot "
"skip any pod in a pool of five or fewer prefill pods at ``N = 2``; the cap"
" applies at any pool size. The lowest-scoring pod per roleset is kept as "
"the roleset's prefill candidate."
msgstr ""
"每个 prefill Pod 按所选策略打分。请求数高于均值超过 ``N`` 个标准差的 Pod 会被跳过（``N = "
"AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_STANDARD_DEVIATION_FACTOR`` ），请求数高于 ``c × (mean + 1)`` "
"的 Pod 也会被跳过（``c = AIBRIX_PREFILL_LOAD_CAP_FACTOR`` ）。在 ``N = 2`` 时，标准差检查"
"无法在 prefill Pod 不超过五个的池中跳过任何 Pod；该上限对任意规模的池都生效。每个 roleset "
"保留分数最低的 Pod 作为该 roleset 的 prefill 候选。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:759
msgid ""
"``prefix_cache`` (default): ``score = (100 − prefix_match_percent) × 0.1 "
"+ req_count / max_req_count`` — lower score means more cache hits and "
"less load. Matches below ``AIBRIX_MIN_MATCH_PCT`` count as ``0``."
msgstr ""
"``prefix_cache`` （默认）：``score = (100 − prefix_match_percent) × 0.1 + "
"req_count / max_req_count`` — 分数越低表示 cache 命中越多、负载越低。低于 "
"``AIBRIX_MIN_MATCH_PCT`` 的匹配计为 ``0`` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:760
msgid "``least_request``: ``score = req_count``."
msgstr "``least_request`` ：``score = req_count`` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:761
msgid ""
"``conductor``: estimates TTFT from queue time, cached prefix time, and "
"unmatched prefill time; see `Conductor Scoring Policy`_."
msgstr ""
"``conductor``：根据排队时间、已缓存前缀时间和未匹配 prefill 时间估算 TTFT；见 `Conductor Scoring "
"Policy`_。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:762
msgid ""
"``token_load``: ``score = active_tokens + kv_weight × kv_tokens`` — the "
"token-weighted load the router has charged to the pod; see :ref:`Token "
"Load Scoring Policy <pd-token-load-policy>`."
msgstr ""
"``token_load`` ：``score = active_tokens + kv_weight × kv_tokens`` — "
"路由器已计入该 Pod 的按 token 加权负载；见 :ref:`Token Load Scoring Policy <pd-token-"
"load-policy>` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:763
msgid ""
"``hybrid_cache_load``: ``score = load × (1 − (prefix_match_percent / "
"100)² × factor)``, or just the discount when the pod is idle — cache "
"affinity decides between idle pods, load between busy ones; see "
":ref:`Hybrid Cache-Load Scoring Policy <pd-hybrid-cache-load-policy>`."
msgstr ""
"``hybrid_cache_load`` ：``score = load × (1 − (prefix_match_percent / "
"100)² × factor)`` ，Pod 空闲时则仅为折扣——空闲 Pod 之间由 cache 亲和决定，繁忙 Pod 之间由负载决定；见 "
":ref:`Hybrid Cache-Load Scoring Policy <pd-hybrid-cache-load-policy>` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:765
msgid "**Step 4 — Decode scoring**"
msgstr "**步骤 4 — Decode 打分**"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:767
msgid ""
"Each decode pod is scored by the selected policy. Pods without "
"``RealtimeNumRequestsRunning`` receive a cold-start score (``1.0 + "
"pending_decode_count``) when at least one sibling pod already has "
"metrics, so they compete fairly without attracting all traffic "
"immediately."
msgstr ""
"每个 decode Pod 按所选策略打分。没有 ``RealtimeNumRequestsRunning`` 的 Pod，在至少一个兄弟 Pod"
" 已有指标时，会得到冷启动分数（``1.0 + pending_decode_count`` ），从而能公平竞争，又不会立刻吸走全部流量。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:769
msgid ""
"``load_balancing`` (default): ``score = (w_run × norm_reqs + w_thru × (1 "
"− norm_throughput)) / norm_free_gpu``, where norms are relative to the "
"batch maximum; lower is better."
msgstr ""
"``load_balancing`` （默认）：``score = (w_run × norm_reqs + w_thru × (1 − "
"norm_throughput)) / norm_free_gpu`` ，其中归一化相对本批最大值；越低越好。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:770
msgid "``least_request``: ``score = running_reqs + pending_decode_count``."
msgstr "``least_request`` ：``score = running_reqs + pending_decode_count`` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:771
msgid ""
"``conductor``: estimates TBT from current throughput, batch scaling, and "
"GPU pressure; see `Conductor Scoring Policy`_."
msgstr ""
"``conductor``：根据当前吞吐、批处理放大和 GPU 压力估算 TBT；见 `Conductor Scoring Policy`_。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:772
msgid ""
"``token_load``: ``score = decode_tokens + generated_tokens``; see "
":ref:`Token Load Scoring Policy <pd-token-load-policy>`."
msgstr ""
"``token_load``：``score = decode_tokens + generated_tokens``；见 :ref:`Token "
"Load Scoring Policy <pd-token-load-policy>`。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:774
msgid "**Step 5 — Final pair selection**"
msgstr "**步骤 5 — 最终配对选择**"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:776
msgid ""
"For each roleset with both a prefill and decode candidate, the gateway "
"computes:"
msgstr "对同时有 prefill 和 decode 候选的每个 roleset，网关计算："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:782
msgid ""
"The roleset with the lowest combined score wins. The selected prefill and"
" decode pods always come from the same roleset."
msgstr "综合分数最低的 roleset 胜出。所选 prefill 和 decode Pod 始终来自同一 roleset。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:786
msgid "Environment Variables"
msgstr "环境变量"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:788
msgid "These are set on the **gateway plugin** deployment."
msgstr "这些变量设置在 **网关插件** 的 deployment 上。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:797
msgid "``AIBRIX_PROMPT_LENGTH_BUCKETING``"
msgstr "``AIBRIX_PROMPT_LENGTH_BUCKETING``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:798
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:801
msgid "``false``"
msgstr "``false``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:799
msgid ""
"Enable prompt-length bucket matching for prefill, decode, and standard "
"inference pods."
msgstr "为 prefill、decode 和标准推理 Pod 启用 prompt 长度分桶匹配。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:800
msgid "``AIBRIX_BUCKET_SERVE``"
msgstr "``AIBRIX_BUCKET_SERVE``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:802
msgid "Enable adaptive bucket serving on top of prompt-length bucketing."
msgstr "在 prompt 长度分桶之上启用自适应分桶服务。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:803
msgid "``AIBRIX_BUCKET_SERVE_MODE``"
msgstr "``AIBRIX_BUCKET_SERVE_MODE``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:804
msgid "``throughput``"
msgstr "``throughput``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:805
msgid ""
"Objective of the adaptive cut points: ``throughput`` (prompt token mass) "
"or ``rps`` (request counts). An unknown value keeps the default."
msgstr "自适应切分点的目标：``throughput`` （prompt token 质量）或 ``rps`` （请求数）。无法识别的值保持默认。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:806
msgid "``AIBRIX_PREFILL_REQUEST_TIMEOUT``"
msgstr "``AIBRIX_PREFILL_REQUEST_TIMEOUT``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:807
msgid "``30``"
msgstr "``30``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:808
msgid "Seconds before a prefill request to a prefill pod times out."
msgstr "发往 prefill Pod 的 prefill 请求超时秒数。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:809
msgid "``AIBRIX_PREFILL_SCORE_POLICY``"
msgstr "``AIBRIX_PREFILL_SCORE_POLICY``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:810
msgid "``prefix_cache``"
msgstr "``prefix_cache``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:811
msgid ""
"Default scoring policy for selecting prefill pods. ``prefix_cache``, "
"``least_request``, ``conductor``, ``token_load``, or "
"``hybrid_cache_load``."
msgstr ""
"选择 prefill Pod 的默认打分策略。``prefix_cache`` 、``least_request`` 、``conductor``"
" 、``token_load`` 或 ``hybrid_cache_load`` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:814
msgid ""
"``token_load`` and ``hybrid_cache_load``. Weight of resident KV tokens in"
" the prefill score. Must be positive."
msgstr "``token_load`` 和 ``hybrid_cache_load`` 。驻留 KV token 在 prefill 分数中的权重。必须为正。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:817
msgid ""
"``token_load`` and ``hybrid_cache_load``. Fixed per-request cost, in "
"tokens, added to every prefill charge. Must be positive."
msgstr ""
"``token_load`` 和 ``hybrid_cache_load`` 。每次 prefill 计费都加上的固定每请求成本，单位为 "
"token。必须为正。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:820
msgid ""
"``token_load`` and ``hybrid_cache_load``. Charges older than this are "
"force-released and logged; must exceed the longest legitimate request. "
"Must be positive."
msgstr ""
"``token_load`` 和 ``hybrid_cache_load`` "
"。超过该时长的计费会被强制释放并记录日志；必须大于最长合法请求。必须为正。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:823
msgid ""
"``token_load`` and ``hybrid_cache_load``. How long the last prompt size "
"of an ``x-aibrix-session-key`` session is remembered for the session-"
"delta charge. ``0`` turns the session-delta rule off; otherwise must be "
"positive."
msgstr ""
"``token_load`` 和 ``hybrid_cache_load`` 。为会话增量计费记住 ``x-aibrix-session-"
"key`` 会话上次 prompt 大小的时长。``0`` 关闭会话增量规则；否则必须为正。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:826
msgid ""
"``token_load`` and ``hybrid_cache_load``. Maximum number of sessions "
"remembered at once for the session-delta charge. Must be positive."
msgstr "``token_load`` 和 ``hybrid_cache_load`` 。会话增量计费同时记住的最大会话数。必须为正。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:829
msgid ""
"``hybrid_cache_load`` only. Discount a full prefix match applies to a "
"pod's token load, ``0`` to ``1``. ``1`` makes a fully matched pod always "
"win; ``0`` turns the discount off."
msgstr ""
"仅 ``hybrid_cache_load`` 。完全前缀匹配对 Pod token 负载应用的折扣，``0`` 到 ``1`` 。``1`` "
"使完全匹配的 Pod 总是胜出；``0`` 关闭折扣。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:832
msgid ""
"``prefix_cache`` and ``hybrid_cache_load``. Prefix matches below this "
"percentage are ignored, ``0`` to ``100``. ``0`` disables the threshold."
msgstr ""
"``prefix_cache`` 和 ``hybrid_cache_load`` 。低于该百分比的前缀匹配会被忽略，``0`` 到 ``100``"
" 。``0`` 关闭阈值。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:833
msgid "``AIBRIX_DECODE_TOKEN_LOAD_OUTPUT_GROWTH``"
msgstr "``AIBRIX_DECODE_TOKEN_LOAD_OUTPUT_GROWTH``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:834
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:837
msgid "``true``"
msgstr "``true``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:835
msgid ""
"``token_load`` decode policy only. Adds an estimate of the output "
"generated so far to the decode score. ``false`` scores prompt tokens "
"only."
msgstr ""
"仅用于 ``token_load`` decode 策略。把迄今已生成输出的估计加入 decode 分数。``false`` 只按 prompt "
"token 计分。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:836
msgid "``AIBRIX_TOKEN_LOAD_SHARED_LEDGER``"
msgstr "``AIBRIX_TOKEN_LOAD_SHARED_LEDGER``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:838
msgid ""
"``token_load`` decode policy only, with Redis configured. Shares the "
"decode ledger across gateway replicas through Redis. ``false`` keeps it "
"local to each replica."
msgstr ""
"仅用于 ``token_load`` decode 策略，且已配置 Redis。通过 Redis 在网关副本之间共享 decode "
"账本。``false`` 则每个副本使用本地账本。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:841
msgid "``AIBRIX_DECODE_TOKEN_LOAD_CAPACITY_AWARE``"
msgstr "``AIBRIX_DECODE_TOKEN_LOAD_CAPACITY_AWARE``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:843
msgid ""
"``token_load`` decode policy only. Scales each decode pod's score by its "
"KV capacity, read from the engine metrics, so pods of different sizes are"
" compared by how full they are. ``false`` compares token counts."
msgstr ""
"仅用于 ``token_load`` decode 策略。按每个 decode pod 的 "
"KV 容量（从引擎指标读取）缩放其分数，使不同大小的 pod 按填满程度比较。``false`` "
"则比较 token 数。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:839
msgid "``AIBRIX_DECODE_SCORE_POLICY``"
msgstr "``AIBRIX_DECODE_SCORE_POLICY``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:840
msgid "``load_balancing``"
msgstr "``load_balancing``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:841
msgid ""
"Default scoring policy for selecting decode pods. ``load_balancing``, "
"``least_request``, ``conductor``, or ``token_load``."
msgstr ""
"选择 decode Pod 的默认打分策略。``load_balancing``、``least_request``、``conductor`` 或 "
"``token_load``。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:842
msgid "``AIBRIX_KV_CONNECTOR_TYPE``"
msgstr "``AIBRIX_KV_CONNECTOR_TYPE``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:843
msgid "``shfs``"
msgstr "``shfs``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:844
msgid ""
"vLLM KV transfer adapter. ``shfs`` for GPU (SHFS/KVCacheManager), "
"``nixl`` for Neuron. TRT-LLM transfer backends are configured on the "
"workers."
msgstr ""
"vLLM KV 传输适配器。GPU 用 ``shfs`` （SHFS/KVCacheManager），Neuron 用 ``nixl`` 。TRT-LLM "
"传输后端在 worker 上配置。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:845
msgid "``AIBRIX_PREFILL_LOAD_IMBALANCE_MIN_SPREAD``"
msgstr "``AIBRIX_PREFILL_LOAD_IMBALANCE_MIN_SPREAD``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:846
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:849
msgid "``16``"
msgstr "``16``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:847
msgid ""
"Minimum request-count spread between prefill pods before load-imbalance "
"routing kicks in."
msgstr "prefill Pod 之间触发负载不均衡路由所需的最小请求数差。"

msgid "``AIBRIX_PREFILL_LOAD_CAP_FACTOR``"
msgstr "``AIBRIX_PREFILL_LOAD_CAP_FACTOR``"

msgid ""
"Prefill pods with more than ``c × (mean + 1)`` in-flight prefill requests "
"are skipped, where ``c`` is this factor. A factor between ``0`` and ``1`` "
"is treated as ``1``; ``0``, negative or unparsable values use the default "
"``1.5``. To effectively disable the cap, set a large value such as "
"``100``. Lower values give up more prefix-cache affinity: with random "
"(Poisson) load and no hot pod, ``1.5`` skips at least one pod on up to "
"about 10% of requests with 4 prefill pods and about 20% with 6. ``2`` "
"skips less often but cannot fire in a two-pod pool."
msgstr ""
"进行中的 prefill 请求数超过 ``c × (mean + 1)`` 的 prefill Pod 会被跳过，其中 ``c`` "
"为该系数。介于 ``0`` 与 ``1`` 之间的系数按 ``1`` 处理；``0``、负数或无法解析的值使用默认值 ``1.5``。如需实际关闭该上限，可设置一个较大的值，例如 ``100``。系数越小，牺牲的前缀缓存亲和性越多：在随机（泊松）负载且没有热点 Pod "
"时，``1.5`` 在 4 个 prefill Pod 时最多约 10% 的请求、在 6 个时约 20% 的请求会跳过至少一个 Pod。``2`` "
"跳过得更少，但在两个 Pod 的池中无法生效。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:848
msgid "``AIBRIX_DECODE_LOAD_IMBALANCE_MIN_SPREAD``"
msgstr "``AIBRIX_DECODE_LOAD_IMBALANCE_MIN_SPREAD``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:850
msgid ""
"Minimum ``(max − min)`` running request count spread between decode pods "
"before request-count load-imbalance routing kicks in."
msgstr "decode Pod 之间触发按请求数的负载不均衡路由所需的最小 ``(max − min)`` 运行请求数差。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:851
msgid "``AIBRIX_DECODE_THROUGHPUT_IMBALANCE_MIN_SPREAD``"
msgstr "``AIBRIX_DECODE_THROUGHPUT_IMBALANCE_MIN_SPREAD``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:852
msgid "``2048``"
msgstr "``2048``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:853
msgid ""
"Minimum ``(max − min)`` token throughput spread (tok/s) between decode "
"pods before throughput-based load-imbalance routing kicks in."
msgstr "decode Pod 之间触发按吞吐的负载不均衡路由所需的最小 ``(max − min)`` token 吞吐差（tok/s）。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:854
msgid "``AIBRIX_DECODE_SCORE_RATIO_THRESHOLD``"
msgstr "``AIBRIX_DECODE_SCORE_RATIO_THRESHOLD``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:855
msgid "``1.5``"
msgstr "``1.5``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:856
msgid ""
"``max_drain_score / min_drain_score`` ratio above which the drain-rate "
"routing fast path is triggered. Score for each pod is "
"``effective_running_reqs / drain_rate``."
msgstr ""
"触发排空速率路由快速路径的 ``max_drain_score / min_drain_score`` 比值。每个 Pod 的分数为 "
"``effective_running_reqs / drain_rate`` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:857
msgid "``AIBRIX_DECODE_LB_WEIGHT_RUNNING``"
msgstr "``AIBRIX_DECODE_LB_WEIGHT_RUNNING``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:858
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:861
msgid "``1.0``"
msgstr "``1.0``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:859
msgid ""
"Weight applied to the normalized running-request term in the "
"``load_balancing`` decode score numerator."
msgstr "``load_balancing`` decode 分数分子中，归一化运行请求项的权重。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:860
msgid "``AIBRIX_DECODE_LB_WEIGHT_THROUGHPUT``"
msgstr "``AIBRIX_DECODE_LB_WEIGHT_THROUGHPUT``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:862
msgid ""
"Weight applied to the normalized inverse-throughput term in the "
"``load_balancing`` decode score numerator."
msgstr "``load_balancing`` decode 分数分子中，归一化逆吞吐项的权重。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:863
msgid "``AIBRIX_TRT_MACHINE_ID``"
msgstr "``AIBRIX_TRT_MACHINE_ID``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:865
msgid ""
"10-bit machine ID used in Snowflake-style ``disagg_request_id`` "
"generation for TensorRT-LLM (valid range: ``[0, 1024)``). Must differ "
"between gateway processes sharing TRT workers."
msgstr ""
"用于 TensorRT-LLM Snowflake 风格 ``disagg_request_id`` 生成的 10 位机器 ID（有效范围 ``[0, "
"1024)``）。共享 TRT worker 的网关进程必须互不相同。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:866
msgid "``AIBRIX_TRT_SCHEDULE_STYLE``"
msgstr "``AIBRIX_TRT_SCHEDULE_STYLE``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:867
msgid "``context_first``"
msgstr "``context_first``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/pd-disaggregation.rst:868
msgid ""
"TRT-LLM dispatch mode: ``context_first`` or ``generation_first``. Set on "
"the gateway plugin; read at PD router initialization. "
"``generation_first`` requires the Python KV-cache transceiver on both "
"worker roles. An unrecognized value is logged and falls back to "
"``context_first``."
msgstr ""
